@startuml
skinparam DefaultTextAlignment center
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #F9F9F9

[*] --> Locked : Course Enrolled / Previous Lesson Incomplete\n(FR-ACCESS-02, 03)

Locked --> Available : Previous Lesson Completed\n[OR Student Starts from Any Module - FR-ACCESS-01]

Available --> InProgress : Student Opens & Starts Lesson Content\n(FR-PROGRESS-03 / UC-07)

InProgress --> Completed : Student Completes Required Content\n(FR-PROGRESS-01, 03 / UC-07)\n[Unlocks Next Sequential Lesson]

Completed --> Available : Next Lesson Unlocked\n(FR-ACCESS-02, 03)
Completed --> [*] : End of Module / Course Reached
@enduml